# Starseer Mentor: "At the beginning of your end step, if you gained or lost life this turn, target opponent loses 3 life unless they
# sacrifice a nonland permanent of their choice or discard a card." (CR 603.4, 608.2d, 119.3). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with Black Lotus,
# Mox Pearl and Mox Jet ({3}{W}{B}). On turn 3 it attacks, flying over Bot2's Memnite and, with vigilance, staying untapped (3 damage),
# then Lightning Helix gains Bot1 3 life (3 more damage). At its end step Bot2, holding a card and a Memnite, chooses to lose 3 life
# rather than give either: 20 - 3 - 3 - 3 = 11, and it keeps its card and its Memnite.

